	quest.0000000000105580.quest_desc: ["Hood, cape, bottoms and boots of aethersent: the sky-weave set.", "It fell from the sky with the meteors - weave it back."],
	quest.0000000000105580.title: "Эфиросцентное облачение",
	quest.0000000000105590.quest_desc: ["The alchemist set breathes where nothing breathes; air sac boots soften falls.", "The Abyss becomes a little kinder with them."],
	quest.0000000000105590.title: "Маска, одеяние, ботинки",
	quest.00000000001055A0.quest_desc: ["Keeper, forge, blooming and twining: four patterns for the smithing table.", "Decoration is also content: the encyclopaedia counts trims separately."],
	quest.00000000001055A0.title: "Четыре узора отделки",
